               summary="Why everything a plugin adds carries its namespace, and what happens when two claim the same name">Namespaces and identifiers</a>
            <a href="reporting.topic" type="support"
               summary="The convention every interface here is built around, and what containment does and does not cover">Report rather than throw</a>
            <a href="loading-plugins.topic" type="development"
               summary="Discovery, an instance installed directly, the allowlist, and which drivers ask for either">Loading and isolating plugins</a>
            <a href="contribute-an-injection-point.topic" type="account"
